Package: shinyOAuthDB
Title: Use Database OAuth Access in Shiny Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Luka", "Koning", email = "koningluka@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Use a Shiny visitor's own database access with 'DBI', 'dbplyr',
    'fabricQueryR', and 'brickster'. Connects 'shinyOAuth' sign-in to database
    connections and platform API calls, with connection reuse and cleanup for
    each visitor. Supports Azure SQL, Microsoft Fabric, Databricks, Snowflake,
    and Azure PostgreSQL.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lukakoning/shinyOAuthDB
BugReports: https://github.com/lukakoning/shinyOAuthDB/issues
